REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0016

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

Real failure case: PACE's own project lost a decision because it lived
only in the chat. Decisions must be captured into PACE at the moment they
happen, and PACE must eventually do this capture itself.

RAW_TEXT

Eso quiere decir que pace falla porque no mantiene el historico del chat,
pasan estas cosas.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

What happened: the President confirmed in chat that the page publishes at
the first official launch. The confirmation was never written to
.pace/decisions/. The chat context was later compacted; the AI reread the
summary, found no trace, and treated the decision as new. Diagnosis: not
a memory failure of either party - a capture failure. Immediate remedy:
RULE-0008 (same-turn capture, now in force) + DECISION-0002 (recorded).
Product remedy: this is the strongest real-world case for F2-11 (per-chat
continuity capsule, REQUEST-0009) and F6-30 (agent mode): PACE should sit
inside the conversation loop and capture approved decisions in real time,
instead of depending on the AI's discipline.

PROMOTED_TO

RULE-0008 (in force) + evidence case for F2-11 and F6-30

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
